chain.description:
Blockchain to get balance from. One same address can have different balances in different blockchains.

Supported values:
- `ethereum`;
- `binance`;
- `polygon`;
- `solana`;
- `ethereum-ropsten`;
- `ethereum-rinkeby`;
- `ethereum-goerli`;
- `ethereum-kovan`;
- `binance-testnet`;
- `polygon-mumbai`.

Mobile Phone Specs Database.Get {Phone I.description:
